    out.append(f"**BM. Verify semantics.** Validates project metadata against standard Software Package Data Exchange (SPDX) specifications.\n\n")
    out.append(f"**BN. Bound conclusions.** Prohibits claiming 'Zero Vulnerabilities' unless both SAST and dependency scanning tools completed without error.\n\n")
    out.append(f"**BO. Explain limitations.** Displays limitation notice if repository contains binary files or unparseable proprietary file formats.\n\n")
    out.append(f"**BP. Preserve lineage.** Traces project configuration changes back to user sessions, commit SHAs, and timestamped audit logs.\n\n")
