    out.append(f"**CB. Redact exports.** Exports automatically strip internal IP addresses, deploy keys, and proprietary environment variables.\n\n")
    out.append(f"**CC. Synchronize projections.** Synchronizes project status across frontend clients via WebSocket within $< 50$ms of status change.\n\n")
    out.append(f"**CD. Instrument execution.** Emits OpenTelemetry trace `project.analyze` with tags `project_id`, `file_count`, `parse_duration_ms`.\n\n")
