    out.append(f"**CG. Account costs.** Tracks storage utilization and compute seconds expended during project indexing for workspace billing.\n\n")
    out.append(f"**CH. Monitor saturation.** Alerts if indexing queue backlog exceeds 20 pending projects per worker pool.\n\n")
    out.append(f"**CI. Classify failures.** Codes: `ERR_REPO_CLONE_FAILED` (502), `ERR_PARSER_SYNTAX_ERROR` (422), `ERR_PROJECT_QUOTA` (429).\n\n")
